{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Strategic Bastion",
    "steam_appid": 3705000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Challenging Single-Player Strategy Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a turn-based strategy simulation game with considerable difficulty, perfect for players seeking a real challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various map scenarios where players can select a faction and strive to unify the land by developing their nation and eliminating all rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map scenarios come in small, medium, and large sizes, allowing players to choose based on their preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of two main sections:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Map</strong>: Semi-real-time combat mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internal Affairs</strong>: Activated after each in-game month ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps &amp; Scenarios</strong><br>Currently designed maps include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Kingdoms Period</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warring States Period (Sengoku Japan)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantasy Maps: Serene Moonlight / Wings in the Wind / Animal World / Ice &amp; Fire Island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical Scenarios: Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms / Tang &amp; Song Dynasties / Battle of Gaixia</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Difficulty Levels</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy / Normal / Hard / Hell<br>Each difficulty offers significantly different gameplay experiences to suit all types of players.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Depth Internal Affairs System</strong><br>Manage your nation through 8 key facilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grand Hall (Administration) / Tech Research / Armory / Item Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shogunate (Personnel) / Prison / Minister of Agriculture / Training Ground<br>\u203b Additional functions like capital city customization are also available.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General Skills</strong>: 18 carefully balanced abilities (overpowered skills removed to ensure strategic depth)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Unit Types</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy Infantry / Swordsmen / Assassins (can blink to enemy backlines)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombers (AOE damage) / Magic Troops / Archers</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation &amp; Synergy</strong>: Unit composition, skill combinations, and formations are crucial to victory!</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
