stration) / Tech Research / Armory / Item Workshop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shogunate (Personnel) / Prison / Minister of Agriculture / Training Ground<br>\u203b Additional functions like capital city customization are also available.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>General Skills</strong>: 18 carefully balanced abilities (overpowered skills removed to ensure strategic depth)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Unit Types</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy Infantry / Swordsmen / Assassins (can blink to enemy backlines)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bombers (AOE damage) / Magic Troops / Archers</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation &amp; Synergy</strong>: Unit composition, skill combinations, and formations are crucial to victory!</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
